    "objetivo": "Form the imperfetto, use it for habits, descriptions, age, time, weather and states, and tell childhood memories with «da bambino/a», «mentre» and «c'era». Avoid the English-speaker traps: «would» as the conditional, «was» for age and weather, and the singular for the hours.",
